<title>USA: BANKING-QUICK &amp; REILLY URGENT.</title>
<headline>BANKING-QUICK &amp; REILLY URGENT.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Major discount broker Quick &amp; Reilly Group Inc Tuesday declined comment on press reports about a possible sale of the company.</p>
<p>&quot;As a matter of policy, we do not comment on rumors or speculation about Quick &amp; Reilly's involvement in mergers and acquisitions,&quot; the company said in a prepared statement.</p>
</text>
